{
	"comment": [
		"W695.6 — IKEA/GitHub Copilot seat as a first-class claude-* upstream.",
		"Operator overlay TEMPLATE: copy these groups into the machine",
		"BUCKLE_UPSTREAMS file (merged over upstreams.json by group name). Never",
		"committed as the active default — the seat token lives only in the env var",
		"named by api_key_env (GITHUB_COPILOT_PAT, resolved into buckle-spoke.env",
		"from the 0600 copilot.key chain; the value is never printed or committed).",
		"",
		"Wire facts (2026-10-12): api.githubcopilot.com SERVES the Anthropic",
		"Messages wire — POST /v1/messages answers with Bearer auth +",
		"Copilot-Integration-Id (quota-exhausted 429s observed live, with",
		"x-ratelimit-* headers; W684 verified real tool_calls on /chat/completions",
		"the same day). Same dialect as the lane client => byte-identical",
		"pass-through, no bridge, no litellm (its /v1/messages bridge hits the",
		"Responses API, which Copilot rejects; its github_copilot provider forces",
		"an interactive device flow). SSE + tool_use on THIS wire: unverified.",
		"Path shapes (W935): /v1/messages + /v1/responses are served WITH /v1;",
		"chat completions is NOT — /chat/completions (W684 verified live). The",
		"openai rows carry adapter_config.path_rewrite to match; buckle forwards",
		"unlisted paths verbatim.",
		"",
		"Group name = the wire id lanes send; `model:` = the seat's real id.",
		"Claude groups keep their existing dash aliases. Other models use catalog ids."
	],
